data: {"id": "b280aff6d3804203-thinking-parallel_evidence-532", "run_id": "b280aff6d3804203", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "收到首轮预采集结果，现在需要补充 kubectl_describe 获取 Pod 详细状态和事件，以及 topology 确认拓扑关系。\n\n已采集事实：\n- **Metrics**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}`=1，`kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}`=1，`restarts_total`=0 → 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 且容器等待原因为 ImagePullBackOff。\n- **Logging**: Elasticsearch 最近 30 分钟日志为空 → 容器未启动，无业务日志。\n- **Tracing**: DeepFlow 和 Tempo 均无数据 → 无流量，容器未启动。\n\n下一步：通过 `kubectl_describe` 获取 Events 以判断 ImagePullBackOff 的具体原因（DNS、registry、认证等）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789443476974, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

