event: thinking
data: {"id": "b280aff6d3804203-thinking-parallel_evidence-1018", "run_id": "b280aff6d3804203", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 | 意义 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **K8s Describe** | Pod `workload` 状态 **Pending**，容器 `app` 等待原因 **ImagePullBackOff** | 确认异常仍存在，未恢复 |\n| **Events 原文** | `Failed to pull image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\"` → `rpc error: code = NotFound desc = ... not found` | 镜像 tag `aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在仓库中 **不存在**（manifest unknown/not found） |\n| **Metrics** | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789443484801, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b280aff6d3804203-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "b280aff6d3804203", "seq": 1019, "ts_ms": 1789443492763, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 25.996, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v07", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b280aff6d3804203-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "66aa010a0444010a481106718ec129d993cdeba13253ec30734071e05d622635", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "4356f583b6feae9433a02e458ac615f8009c76e1d86def185493e9c61f83e2c8"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "b280aff6d3804203-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "b280aff6d3804203", "seq": 1020, "ts_ms": 1789443492764, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b280aff6d3804203-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "b280aff6d3804203", "seq": 1021, "ts_ms": 1789443501539, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.775, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1701, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v07/workload 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，持续 Pending 且无重启。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.status: Pending | 确认 Pod 当前未进入运行状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed (x4): Error: ErrImagePull | 提供初步拉取失败警告 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed (x6): Error: ImagePullBackOff | 确认 kubelet 进入拉取重试退避状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Normal BackOff (x154): Back-off pulling image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\" | 说明拉取动作正在持续重试且受阻 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed: rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to resolve reference ...: not found | 明确镜像拉取失败的底层具体原因 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason: ImagePullBackOff) | 佐证 Pod 处于等待状态的原因 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0 | 确认应用容器从未成功启动过 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n事件记录 (fact-4 至 fact-5) 直接提供了具体的错误代码 `NotFound` 和缺少的镜像引用路径，确证了拉取失败的根本原因；指标数据 (fact-6) 独立验证了容器状态为 `ImagePullBackOff`，与 Kubernetes 状态事实 (fact-1) 完全一致；重启计数 (fact-7) 排除了应用崩溃重启的可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像仓库中 tag 'aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 不存在 → kubelet 拉取镜像失败 (NotFound) → Pod 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 → 应用服务不可用 (Pending)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**容器镜像 tag 不存在**。Kubernetes 事件记录 (fact-5) 明确指出镜像 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在仓库中不存在（code = NotFound），导致 `kubelet` 无法拉取并启动该镜像（fact-3），从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（fact-1, fact-6），应用服务因此不可用。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v07/workload 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，持续 Pending 且无重启。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.status: Pending | 确认 Pod 当前未进入运行状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed (x4): Error: ErrImagePull | 提供初步拉取失败警告 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed (x6): Error: ImagePullBackOff | 确认 kubelet 进入拉取重试退避状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Normal BackOff (x154): Back-off pulling image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\" | 说明拉取动作正在持续重试且受阻 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning Failed: rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to resolve reference ...: not found | 明确镜像拉取失败的底层具体原因 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason: ImagePullBackOff) | 佐证 Pod 处于等待状态的原因 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0 | 确认应用容器从未成功启动过 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n事件记录 (fact-4 至 fact-5) 直接提供了具体的错误代码 `NotFound` 和缺少的镜像引用路径，确证了拉取失败的根本原因；指标数据 (fact-6) 独立验证了容器状态为 `ImagePullBackOff`，与 Kubernetes 状态事实 (fact-1) 完全一致；重启计数 (fact-7) 排除了应用崩溃重启的可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像仓库中 tag 'aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 不存在 → kubelet 拉取镜像失败 (NotFound) → Pod 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 → 应用服务不可用 (Pending)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**容器镜像 tag 不存在**。Kubernetes 事件记录 (fact-5) 明确指出镜像 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在仓库中不存在（code = NotFound），导致 `kubelet` 无法拉取并启动该镜像（fact-3），从而使 Pod 持续处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（fact-1, fact-6），应用服务因此不可用。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

